online arbitrage on Amazon or Walmart, you need a scanner. ScanUnlimited is popular. It&#x27;s fast and cheap. But is it the right tool for your business? The answer depends on what you&#x27;re selling, where you&#x27;re selling, and whether you want to stay in one tool or integrate sourcing with inventory management, repricing, and order management.</p></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades" id="comparison"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Head-to-Head Comparison</h2></div><div class="pgx-302"><table class="pgx-76 pgx-663"><thead><tr class="pgx-303"><th class="pgx-304">Feature</th><th class="pgx-304">ScanUnlimited</th><th class="pgx-304">Ecom Circles</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Speed (items/min)</td><td class="pgx-307">Up to 300</td><td class="pgx-308">250-400 (context-aware)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Amazon Scanning</td><td class="pgx-307">✓ Yes</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes + AI insights</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Walmart Scanning</td><td class="pgx-307">✗ No</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes (UPC-based)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">IP/Brand Restriction Check</td><td class="pgx-307">Limited</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Advanced</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Wholesale Bulk Upload</td><td class="pgx-307">Basic CSV</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Advanced (20K+)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Profit Margin Calculation</td><td class="pgx-307">Basic (Amazon)</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Advanced (both)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Integration w/ Repricer</td><td class="pgx-307">✗ No</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Yes</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Mobile App</td><td class="pgx-307">✓ Barcode scan</td><td class="pgx-308">✓ Full app</td></tr><tr class="pgx-305"><td class="pgx-306">Price per Month</td><td class="pgx-307">$29-$70</td><td class="pgx-308">$27-$297 (full platform)</td></tr><tr class="pgx-309"><td class="pgx-306">Free Trial</td><td class="pgx-307">14 days</td><td class="pgx-308">10,000 scans</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class="pgx-114 bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-4xl"><div class="pgx-46"><h3 class="pgx-115">Ready to Make the Switch?</h3><a class="gradient-bg shadow-btn pg-btn" href="pricing.php">Switch to Ecom Circles<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-3 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">Why Sellers Switch to Ecom Circles</h2></div><div class="pgx-310"><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Walmart Support (Game Changer)</h3><p class="pgx-1">ScanUnlimited doesn&#x27;t support Walmart. Ecom Circles scans Walmart natively. One tool for two major channels.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">IP Protection</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles flags restricted brands BEFORE you buy. Saves thousands on avoided suspension risks.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">All-in-One Ecosystem</h3><p class="pgx-1">Scan, calculate profit, track inventory, set repricing. All in one platform. Less tool switching.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Real Profit Math</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles calculates true profit: product cost + fees + your target margin. ScanUnlimited is often wrong.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Bulk Sourcing Power</h3><p class="pgx-1">Upload 20K items from suppliers. Instant profitability data. ScanUnlimited can&#x27;t do this at scale.</p></div><div class="pgx-58"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">No More Tool Juggling</h3><p class="pgx-1">One platform instead of ScanUnlimited + repricer + inventory manager. Lower total cost.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-49 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">Which Platform for Your Business?</h2><div class="pgx-24"><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Solo RA Seller (Amazon Only)</h3><p class="pgx-1">ScanUnlimited works IF you&#x27;re okay with basic profit math. Switch to Ecom Circles within 3-6 months when you want Walmart or scale.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">OA Seller (Amazon + Walmart)</h3><p class="pgx-1">Use Ecom Circles. ScanUnlimited won&#x27;t scan Walmart. You&#x27;d need a second tool anyway.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Wholesale Sourcing (10K+)</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles only. Designed for wholesale. Upload 10K items, filter by profit. ScanUnlimited can&#x27;t.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Dropshipping (Shopify + Amazon + Walmart)</h3><p class="pgx-1">Ecom Circles. Multi-channel, integrates with Shopify. ScanUnlimited is Amazon-only.</p></div><div class="pgx-312"><h3 class="pgx-26 font-satoshi">Testing (Lowest Budget)</h3><p class="pgx-1">ScanUnlimited is cheapest. But plan to switch. Ecom Circles grows with you; less switching pain later.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-313 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Beyond Scanning: The Full Sourcing Toolkit</h2><div class="pgx-10"><p>Ecom Circles is more than a scanner. Once you&#x27;ve found profitable items, <a class="pgx-314" href="inventory-management.php">track your inventory</a> across all channels in real time, ensuring you never oversell. Know exactly how much stock you have at each warehouse and when you need to reorder.</p><p>Then, keep your prices competitive. <a class="pgx-314" href="repricer.php">Automated repricing rules</a> adjust your prices based on competition, inventory levels, and margin targets. Scan items, load them into inventory, and let repricing maximize your profits. No more manual updates across Amazon and Walmart.</p><p>Not sure whether ScanUnlimited is the right fit for your workflow? We wrote a detailed<!-- --> <a class="pgx-314" href="blog/scan-unlimited-review/index.html">Scan Unlimited review</a> <!-- -->covering its real strengths, limitations, and when it makes sense to upgrade.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-57 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-42"><h2 class="pgx-311 font-satoshi">Scanner Comparison FAQs</h2><div><div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Is ScanUnlimited as fast as Ecom Circles?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Can I import from ScanUnlimited to Ecom Circles?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Do I need Walmart support?</span><span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down pg-faq__chev" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class="pg-faq__item"><button class="pg-faq__btn"><span class="pg-faq__q">Is E